_1767914643498.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"S02E20"},{"s":1795895328,"e":1795898448,"t":"Star Trek: Voyager: Deadlock","st":"Deadlock","d":"A space anomaly generates a duplicate Voyager and crew, but only one ship can survive an assault by Vidiian invaders.","c":["Classic Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Series","Science fiction"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/6278c3825bbb230014ba4abd/tile_1767914643498.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"S02E21"},{"s":1795898448,"e":1795901568,"t":"Star Trek: Voyager: Innocence","st":"Innocence","d":"After crash-landing on a moon, Tuvok encounters three terrified children who claim they've been brought there to die.","c":["Classic Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Series","Science fiction"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/6278c3825bbb230014ba4abd/tile_1767914643498.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"S02E22"},{"s":1795901568,"e":1795904688,"t":"Star Trek: Voyager: The Thaw","st":"The Thaw","d":"Thanks to a complex sensory system controlled by a computer, Kim and others are literally held hostage by fear.","c":["Classic Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Series","Science fiction"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/6278c3825bbb230014ba4abd/tile_1767914643498.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"S02E23"},{"s":1795904688,"e":1795907808,"t":"Star Trek: Voyager: Tuvix","st":"Tuvix","d":"A bizarre occurrence during transport causes Tuvok and Neelix to fuse into one alien humanoid known as \"Tuvix.\"","c":["Classic Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Series","Science fiction"],"i":"https://images.pluto.tv/series/6278c3825bbb230014ba4abd/tile_1767914643498.jpg?fill=blur&fit=fill&fm=jpg&h=900&q=75&w=900","ep":"S02E24"},{"s":1795907808,"e":1795910928,"t":"Star Trek: Voyager: Resolutions","st":"Resolutions","d":"After contracting a deadly virus, Janeway and Chakotay are forced into exile on a planet that shields them from the effects of the fatal disease.","c":["Classic Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Series","Science fiction"],